text: ["Choose one or both —\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target artifact.\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target creature, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types.", 'Essence Extraction deals 3 damage to target creature and you gain 3 life.', "Fabricate 2 (When this creature enters the battlefield, put two +1/+1 counters on it or create two 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature tokens.)\\nWhenever Cultivator of Blades attacks, you may have other attacking creatures get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is Cultivator of Blades's power.", 'Flying\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gains first strike until end of turn.\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gains haste until end of turn.', 'Other artifact creatures you control get +1/+1.']
flavor: ['"From the first touch, I know exactly what the metal wants to be."', 'The foundries of Kaladesh run like clockwork under the supervision of their formidable overseers.']
artist: ['Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Wesley Burt']
